# GD-1 (round 19): a version row `R.x = v` (L §2.3 row, whose qid no longer names a regime's input) names an unknown
# id (L §8.3 LOAD-NAME).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input rate: num

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  gains.rate = 2

ask q: rate
=== expect
refused: LOAD-NAME unknown id gains.rate (m.tally:16)
